Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热浪还在继续 洛杉矶已高达109华氏度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heat wave continues. it's 109 degrees in los angeles.{\r}
